    pr_intro:'This app is fully usable with no sign-up, no payments, and without collecting your information: everything stays on your phone. If you like, you can join the mailing list and we\u2019ll let you know when there\u2019s a new version with more exercises or better features.',
    pr_astro:'<b>A new service for daily introspection based on the day\u2019s astrological transits is coming soon. Don\u2019t miss it: sign up to stay up to date.</b>',
    pr_subscribe:'✉ Join the mailing list',
    pr_sub_txt:'The form opens in your browser: there you enter your email and agree to receive the emails. The app doesn\u2019t store or send your address. To unsubscribe, use the link at the bottom of any email.',
    pr_terms:'Terms of use', pr_privacy:'Privacy policy',
