    pr_accept_chk:'Responsibility acceptance active',
    pr_accept_txt:'If you turn it off, the app will stay locked until you read and accept the notice again.',
    pr_titular:'Open-source app that lives entirely on your device. Service controller: Jordi Beold (artistic name) \u00b7 data: jordibeold@jordibeold.com. This project intends to become an association and, later, The Ninth Path Foundation.',
    pr_upgrade:'Future versions install over the current one, keeping all your settings and library, with no need to uninstall.',
    pr_reset_warn:'⚠️ Resetting will delete all your own practices, your own moments, favorites, paused practices and settings, and will reset the practice schedule from scratch.',
    pr_reset:'Restore initial setup',
    gd_title:'🔒 Ringing with the phone locked',
    gd_realme:'Your phone (realme/OPPO)', gd_some:'Some phones',
    gd_intro:'add several battery-saving layers that hold back or silence reminders when locked. Go through them in order; the names may vary a little by language and version.',
    gd_s1:'<b>1. App battery.</b> <i>Only if reminders fail.</i> Allow <b>background activity</b> and <b>auto-launch</b>. This is the option that uses the most battery, so leave it for when the following steps are not enough. You can also get there via Settings → Battery → "App battery management" → Moment.',
    gd_s2:'<b>2. Optimized standby.</b> In Settings → Battery → <b>More settings</b>, find <b>"Optimized standby"</b> (also called "Sleep standby optimization") and <b>turn it off</b>: it freezes apps when the screen goes off and is the most common cause on realme/OPPO.',
    gd_s3:'<b>3. Quick app freeze.</b> On that same "More settings" screen, if <b>"Quick app freeze"</b> (Quick Freeze) exists, open it and <b>exclude Moment</b> from its list (or turn it off).',
    gd_s4:'<b>4. App permissions.</b> In the app info → Permissions, turn off <b>"Pause app activity if unused"</b>: over time it revokes permissions and stops notifications.',
    gd_s5:'<b>5. Lock in recents.</b> Open the <b>recent apps</b> screen (the ▢ button, or swipe up from the bottom and hold): you\u2019ll see open apps as cards. <b>Long-press the Moment for you card</b> (or tap its three dots ⋮) and choose <b>Lock</b> 🔒. That way the system won\u2019t close it. Note: this lock can be lost when you restart the phone or update the app — set it again now and then. (No direct shortcut.)',
    gd_s6:'<b>6. Sound.</b> Alarm mode rings even on silent, but it uses the <b>alarm volume</b>: check it\u2019s not at zero. Then test: "Test notification" → lock the phone → wait about 20 seconds.',
    gd_diag:'<b>Diagnostic hint:</b> if the reminder arrives <b>all at once</b> when you unlock, the system held it back — review steps 1 to 5. If it arrives on time but <b>without alarm sound</b>, check the channel.',
    gd_open:'Open ↗', gd_open_bat:'Open Battery ↗', gd_open_app:'Open app info ↗',
    gd_open_sound:'Open Sound ↗', gd_open_channel:'Open alarm channel ↗', gd_ok:'Got it',
    ih_title:'Your growth',
    ih_intro:'Here you\u2019ll find statistics of your earlier self and your current self, to see the changes. If you feel demanding, guilty, or proud (or the like) for doing less or more, I invite you to let it be felt but choose another path of expression — one more true to your being, more mature. Maybe, on seeing the notification, you simply decide to breathe consciously, or to forgive and forgive yourself. Whatever is, is; we accept it and keep giving our best, for you and for others.',
    ih_level:'<b>Growth level:</b> advances with the total practices completed — seed 🌰, sprout 🌱, seedling 🌿, rooted 🪴, in bloom 🌷 and tree 🌳.',
    ih_streak:'<b>Streak:</b> consecutive days practicing. The current one holds if you practiced today or yesterday; your best streak is saved too.',
    ih_medals:'<b>Medals:</b> recognize the categories you explore (out of 7) and your longest streaks.',
